                                                                                    "patching_rect": [ 417.0, 203.0, 173.0, 248.0 ],
                                                                                    "text": "analysis of pulse subdivision\n\nuses Barlow’s measure of ‘indispensability’ for a set of metric masks, 'filters' for each possible subdivision that are each multiplied with a box notation representation of the duration pattern.\n\nEach filter is rotated through all possible offsets. the meter and rotation resulting in the highest sum is selected as most likely meter. The offset is saved as an indicator of the most likely starting point (ie pulse starting point)"
                                                                                }
